{
  "note": "layer states for bisection: cacheonly=pristine cache; cachezoo=zoo1perf; z0only=cache+Z0 (crashes on glFinish, see Z0_ROOT_CAUSE); glcostonly=cache+GLCOST; z0v2=cache+Z0(fixed NULL guard)+GLCOST; zoo2=cache+zoo2 P3; zoo3=zoo2+P5 tc z0v2b = z0v2 + file-sink diagnostics (MESA_GLCOST_FILE / ZINK_FENCE_STATS_FILE; needed because javaw launch discards stderr). z0v3 = z0v2b + Z0V3 counter probe (MESA_GLCOST bit3=8 / ZINK_Z0V3_STATS=1, 3 lines per 600 frames + final=1 at destroy; counters only, no behavior change). zoo3a/zoo3b/zoo3c = zoo2 + exactly one upstream tc patch (a=1ca365b2 in-flight-list ring scan, b=5710cae1 const-buffer high-water, c=32658eec busy-reply cap), for zoo3 attribution A/B. glthread1 = zoo2 (P3) + WGL glthread port (stw_context/stw_framebuffer/stw_st), env MESA_ZINK_GLTHREAD=1 default off. glthread1b = glthread1 + optional MESA_ZINK_GLTHREAD_FILE sink (GLTHREAD init/stats/final lines; fflush per line, fclose at destroy). glthread1c = glthread1b + WGL set_background_context callback (fixes glthread init deadlock) + early progress log lines. z0v2binv = z0v2b + one-shot fence-path attribution counters (ZINK_FENCE_STATS gate, ZINK_FENCE_INV line). zoo5 = zoo2 + env-gated swapchain pipeline depth (MESA_ZINK_SWAP_EXTRA_IMAGES / MESA_ZINK_MAX_ACQ_EXTRA / debug), default off = zoo2. zoo6 = zoo2 + env-gated MESA_ZINK_FENCE_NO_SUBMIT_WAIT (skip submit-thread flush_completed wait in fence_wait; default off). zoo7 = zoo2 + zoo6 fence env + research-vk iris patches (ZINK_FB_STATE_EARLYOUT / ZINK_DESC_ACTIVE_PUSH), all default off. zoo8 = zoo7 + env-gated wait-free upload staging (MESA_ZINK_UPLOAD_NOWAIT_STAGING, per-context ring), default off. zoo10 = zoo8 + ZINK_SYNC_FLUSH_ASYNC (skip submit-thread flush_completed wait in sync_flush), default off. zoo11 = zoo10 + MESA_ZINK_UPLOAD_STATS instrumentation (env-gated, zero overhead when off). zoo11b = zoo11 + MESA_ZINK_UPLOAD_STATS_FILE append sink (default off = zoo11 behavior). zoo12 = zoo11b + env-gated small-texture-update staging ring (MESA_ZINK_TEXSUBIMAGE_SMALL_DIRECT) + tex upload counters. zoo13 = zoo12 + env ZINK_RP_INFO_CACHE (same-batch begin_rendering assembly cache), default off. zoo14 = zoo13 unified observation build (desc active push already in chain since zoo7; comment-only source marker so layer detection is distinct), all envs default off. zoo15 = zoo14 + MESA/ZINK_CPUMEAS CPU instrumentation (default off). (zink_cpumeas.h is a plain tree file, not layer-managed.) zoo17 = zoo16 + env MESA_ZINK_STATE_FAST (F1 early-return in _mesa_update_state before texture lock), default off. zoo18 = zoo17 + ZINK_CPUMEAS_MODE (thread-scoped measurement) + ZINK_TC_FENCE_NO_READY_WAIT (P3), both default off. zoo19 = zoo18 + ZINK_FLUSH_SRC_STATS (per-source flush counters), default off. zoo20 = zoo19 + ZINK_DEFERRED_POLL_STATS (deferred poll counters) + ZINK_DEFERRED_POLL_FLUSH/ZINK_DEFERRED_POLL_MIN_US (skip redundant deferred-poll flushes), all default off. zoo21 = zoo20 + ZINK_DEFERRED_POLL_FILE (file sink) + ZINK_CPUMEAS_FRAME_SRC (present-based frame denominator), default off. zoo22 = zoo21 + ZINK_DEFERRED_POLL_FLUSH mode 3 (finished & no pending work only) + bounded MAX_SKIP + skipped_pending/forced_flush counters, default off. zoo23 = zoo22 + CPUMEAS readback slot (bit128; image_map READ branch + buffer_map READ maps), default off. zoo24 = zoo23 source + full clean rebuild (abi_clean + ninja -t clean) for the glGetTexImage deadlock investigation; ZOO24 comment marker only. zoo25 = zoo24 + R19 fixes: restore upstream-conditional flushes broken by ZOO19 hint injection (zink_context.c rebind_buffer_as_image; u_threaded_context.c tc_batch_execute half-ring) + NULL-safe zink_batch_state in deferred poll branch.",
